<p>18.5 <strong>Changes.</strong> The Developer(s) may update this agreement from time to time. The version shipped with the release you use applies to that release, and continued use of a later release is acceptance of the terms shipped with it. The current version is always available from UDAW's Help menu and from the official repository.</p>
<p>18.6 <strong>Headings and interpretation.</strong> Headings are for convenience only. "Including" means "including without limitation".</p>
<p>18.7 <strong>Consumer rights.</strong> Nothing in this agreement excludes or limits any right or remedy that cannot lawfully be excluded or limited, including statutory consumer guarantees where they apply. Where such rights apply, the Developer(s)' liability is limited, to the extent the law permits, to re-supplying the Software or the cost of re-supplying it, which for free software is nil.</p>
